    "id": "185382",
    "original": "会議の席で常務は、開口一番何を言ったと思う。大規模なリストラ計画を発表したんだよな。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "22514",
        "text": "Guess what the managing director started off the meeting by saying. The first thing out of his mouth was an announcement of some major restructuring."
